{"id":"849c766397123ee17ec58f57","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/31/nepal-floods-penny-wong-labor-anthony-albanese-one-nation-pauline-hanson-angus-taylor-liberal-party-ntwnfb","published_at":"2026-08-31T00:37:44Z","collected_at":"2026-08-31T00:54:05.819791Z","title":"Australia news live: Labor working on release of Oscar Jenkins in Russia; record low snowfall in NSW as winter ends","text":"Snowy Hydro data shows 2026 officially the worst end to a season since records began in 1954. Follow the day’s news live Get our breaking news email , free app or daily news podcast The Australian government is working with Russian officials in a bid to secure the release of Australian Oscar Jenkins , Matt Thistlethwaite says. Speaking to ABC news breakfast, the assistant minister for foreign affairs declined to answer whether a prisoner swap was on the table. Obviously, we try and negotiate as best we can on behalf of all Australians who find themselves in difficulties such as this. We obviously have to abide by international laws and we always uphold them. But the Australian officials on the ground will work with their counterparts to ensure that, hopefully he’s returned to Australia safely. Continue reading...","html":"","media":[],"author":"Nick Visser","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"e2854e301add85edd81412a91477348da6ec7356c8f385c677a3faa86ea70af8","original_text_chars":824,"original_html_chars":1298,"text_truncated":false,"media_count":0,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/31/nepal-floods-penny-wong-labor-anthony-albanese-one-nation-pauline-hanson-angus-taylor-liberal-party-ntwnfb","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/australia-news/live/2026/aug/31/nepal-floods-penny-wong-labor-anthony-albanese-on