{"id":"3d41653109e5d78d9007fa81","source":"guardian-rss","source_name":"The Guardian World","platform":"rss","url":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/grand-canyon-flash-flood-arizona-people-missing-evacuated","published_at":"2026-08-31T00:01:41Z","collected_at":"2026-08-31T00:54:31.559326Z","title":"At least 15 people may be missing after flash flood in Arizona’s Grand Canyon","text":"Bright Angel Creek near the Phantom Ranger Station in Arizona’s Grand Canyon is seen after flash flooding from storms on 29 August 2026. Photograph: Parth Desai/AP View image in fullscreen Bright Angel Creek near the Phantom Ranger Station in Arizona’s Grand Canyon is seen after flash flooding from storms on 29 August 2026. Photograph: Parth Desai/AP Arizona At least 15 people may be missing after flash flood in Arizona’s Grand Canyon Dozens evacuated after flash-flood event near Bright Angel Canyon and Phantom Ranch, officials say Coral Murphy Marcos and agencies Sun 30 Aug 2026 20.01 EDT Last modified on Sun 30 Aug 2026 20.02 EDT Share Prefer the Guardian on Google At least 15 people may be missing or unaccounted for after a major flash flood swept through the Grand Canyon national park in Arizona on Saturday afternoon, according to the National Park Service. The flash-flood event occurred in the area of Bright Angel Canyon and the Phantom Ranch, where park staff and the Arizona department of public safety have evacuated more than 60 people as of Sunday morning. No injuries have been reported as of Sunday, according to a statement from the National Park Service. Flooding devastat","html":"","media":["https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/be6ab41ca13f50a425306a5a81b41eeec8ff353a/0_0_8064_6048/master/8064.jpg?width=465&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none","https://i.guim.co.uk/img/media/46330b10d1ff5a25dfd50a054530011acfa5e9f3/0_0_4032_3024/master/4032.jpg?width=445&dpr=1&s=none&crop=none"],"author":"Coral Murphy Marcos and agencies","language":"und","group":"international-media","perspective":"mixed","trust":"high","tags":[],"raw":{"archive_policy":"public_excerpt_v1","content_sha256":"69b2088f7660af526c79d4aaf81ec94a952066461f2ad202ec9d850903c05e89","original_text_chars":2943,"original_html_chars":17845,"text_truncated":true,"media_count":2,"platform":{"entry_id":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/grand-canyon-flash-flood-arizona-people-missing-evacuated","entry_link":"https://www.theguardian.com/us-news/2026/aug/30/grand-canyon-flash-flood-arizona-people-missing-evacuated"}}}
